Output razify-demo.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1000
Set Height 580
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Margin 20
Set BorderRadius 8
Set WindowBar Colorful

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "./razify doctor --fast"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "./razify check"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "./razify init --from-code"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "./razify guard status --agent"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "./razify run --sandbox --dry-run -- go test ./..."
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
